  1:1. Its viewport (101 by 42) is the source SVG's own viewBox, so every
  pathData string below is a direct copy, not rescaled; the 101dp by 42dp
  size matches the 42px height that header renders it at (its 101:42 aspect
  ratio is fixed either way).

  Two literal colors, same as the source: the keyhole is the brand blue-grey
  8FADC7, the lettering is the slightly greyer B5C1CC. Neither is a palette
  token, this is fixed brand artwork, so nothing tints it at runtime.

  Replaced ic_vault_logo.xml (the keyhole on a navy plate, the login
  screen's mark) as the IME top bar's centerpiece. That older drawable is
  no longer referenced by any code.
-->
